{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in a small team of hackers, your mission is to infiltrate XE_CORP's archive database and retrieve vital information for the Edenite Rebellion, crucial to its survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Third-Person Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/f3602ccecb5b984f8cc807f9922308c5.poster.avif?t=1749756223\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/f3602ccecb5b984f8cc807f9922308c5.webm?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/f3602ccecb5b984f8cc807f9922308c5.mp4?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic third-person controls to move your character around, attack, enemies and interact with objects. Collect all the keys to open the door and complete each cipher.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-Person Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/239b579ee28775c22a4b30a5e7f1ecd4.poster.avif?t=1749756223\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/239b579ee28775c22a4b30a5e7f1ecd4.webm?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/239b579ee28775c22a4b30a5e7f1ecd4.mp4?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your character may need a little help. Reach into the cipher with your controllers to move platforms. Also you can stun enemies to make the fighting a little easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-Game Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/8ae878630df8bef20de7bece72a9b295.poster.avif?t=1749756223\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/8ae878630df8bef20de7bece72a9b295.webm?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627240/extras/8ae878630df8bef20de7bece72a9b295.mp4?t=1749756223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and play your own ciphers using the built-in editor. Maybe even share them with your friends (Built in cipher sharing not available, but the files are easily accessible).</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3627240/aa952b9463773712d677f5fd1a79c9b43d371b75.jpg"},{"name":"Things are Heating Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3627240/3ad5bd4f0a5463578910e9c0982ed1abd9de139e.jpg"},{"name":"It's All Up to You Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3627240/cd956b013301333125b34a3ca551d94c8c0e4bbb.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Accomplished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3627240/6297980abd982634b8b61019866b667219dcfe12.jpg"},{"name":"But I Don't Want To...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3627240/e1ef3